7	 * in, so 1 July 2025 – 30 June 2026 is fiscal year 2026. Every date-derived value on an owner (the
8	 * membership-number year segment, the {@code fiscalYear} label and tenure) is measured on this
9	 * basis, always from the business-day-adjusted registration date.
